        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": false,
        "description": "**CodeNexSys – Paid Internship Program \\| 2 Months** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n CodeNexSys is inviting motivated students and fresh graduates to join our\n **2\\-month paid internship** \n program. Gain practical industry exposure, work on real projects, collaborate with professionals, and develop skills in a professional environment.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n 📍\n **Location:** \n North Nazimabad, Karachi\n \n\n\n\n 📅\n **Duration:** \n 2 Months\n \n\n\n\n 🏢\n **Work Mode:** \n Onsite\n \n\n\n\n ⏰\n **Timings:** \n 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM\n \n\n\n\n 💰\n **Stipend:** \n PKR 20,000 – 30,000\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**🔹 Internship Positions** \n\n\n\n* Software Development – .NET\n* Web Development – React\n* Social Media\n* Graphic Design\n* Video Editing\n* Digital Marketing\n* Content \\& Strategy\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**🔹 What You’ll Do** \n\n\n\n\n Depending on your selected department, you will:\n \n\n\n* Support ongoing projects and day\\-to\\-day team activities\n* Work on practical assignments and real client/internal projects\n* Conduct research and contribute creative ideas\n* Collaborate with team members and participate in discussions\n* Complete assigned tasks within deadlines\n* Attend team meetings and learning sessions\n* Receive feedback and continuously develop your skills\n* Follow professional standards and confidentiality requirements\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**🔹 Who Can Apply?** \n\n\n\n* Students currently enrolled in their 3rd or final year\n* Fresh graduates looking to gain practical industry experience\n* Relevant educational background for the selected department\n* At least one relevant internship completed\n* Good communication, teamwork, and time\\-management skills\n* Willingness to learn, accept feedback, and take ownership\n* Able to commit to the complete 2\\-month program\n* Based in Karachi and comfortable with the onsite work arrangement and timings\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**📩 How to Apply** \n\n\n\n\n Send your updated resume to\n **career@codenexsys.com** \n\n\n\n\n Please mention the relevant internship title in the email subject, for example:\n \n\n\n\n**“Application for Web Development Internship”** \n\n\n\n\n**“Application for Digital Marketing Internship”** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Join CodeNexSys, gain real\\-world experience, and take the next step in your professional journey.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#Internship \\#PaidInternship \\#KarachiJobs \\#FreshGraduates \\#Students \\#CodeNexSys \\#SoftwareDevelopment \\#WebDevelopment \\#DigitalMarketing \\#GraphicDesign \\#VideoEditing",
