        "description": "**Company:** \n SWAKIO\n \n\n\n\n**Job Role:** \n Full\\-Stack Developer\n \n\n\n\n**Experience:** \n 2–3\\+ Years\n \n\n\n\n**Job Type:** \n Full\\-Time\n \n\n\n\n**Location:** \n Remote\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**About the Role** \n\n\n\n\n SWAKIO is looking for a passionate Full\\-Stack Developer who can build scalable web applications from scratch. The ideal candidate should have strong experience in modern frontend and backend technologies, API development, database management, and cloud deployment.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Roles \\& Responsibilities** \n\n\n\n* Develop, maintain, and optimise full\\-stack web applications using modern frontend and backend technologies.\n* Build responsive and user\\-friendly interfaces while ensuring high performance and cross\\-browser compatibility.\n* Design and develop RESTful APIs and integrate third\\-party services where required.\n* Work with SQL/NoSQL databases and write efficient, scalable queries.\n* Collaborate with UI/UX designers, product managers, and QA teams to deliver high\\-quality solutions.\n* Deploy, monitor, and maintain applications on cloud platforms while following security and best coding practices.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Required Skills** \n\n\n\n* Strong knowledge of React.js, Next.js, JavaScript, and TypeScript.\n* Experience with Node.js, Express.js or NestJS.\n* Good understanding of MongoDB, PostgreSQL, or MySQL.\n* Experience with REST APIs, Git, Docker, and cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, or GCP.\n* Familiarity with authentication, security, CI/CD, and Agile development practices.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Qualifications** \n\n\n\n* 2–3\\+ years of professional experience in Full\\-Stack Development.\n* Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field (preferred).\n* Strong problem\\-solving and communication skills.\n* Ability to work independently in a remote environment.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Why Join SWAKIO?** \n\n\n\n* 100% Remote work environment.\n* Opportunity to work on innovative AI and SaaS products.\n* Collaborative and fast\\-paced team culture.\n* Career growth with exposure to modern technologies and cloud platforms.",
